=== O20: momentum-difference variant ===
  m1 v1 - m2 v2 - [(m1-m2)V + 2 mu v] = 0
  in the CM frame (V = 0) the literal variant is 2 mu v, i.e. twice k = mu v
  nucleon pair: p*/mu = 1.277e+04 m/s;  literal-variant width p*/(2 mu) = 6386 m/s
  electron pair: p*/mu = 2.347e+07 m/s;  literal-variant width p*/(2 mu) = 1.173e+07 m/s
  1 kg pair: p*/mu = 2.138e-23 m/s;  literal-variant width p*/(2 mu) = 1.069e-23 m/s
